    var heuss = Q.ddp_regionalist_strength + Q.ddp_business_strength > Q.ddp_labor_strength + Q.ddp_liberal_strength;
    var quide = (Q.ddp_labor_strength + Q.ddp_liberal_strength > Q.ddp_regionalist_strength + Q.ddp_business_strength) && !(Q.ddp_labor_strength > Q.ddp_regionalist_strength + Q.ddp_business_strength + Q.ddp_liberal_strength);
    var baumer = Q.ddp_liberal_strength + Q.ddp_regionalist_strength > Q.ddp_business_strength + Q.ddp_labor_strength;
    var erkelenz = Q.ddp_labor_strength > Q.ddp_regionalist_strength + Q.ddp_business_strength + Q.ddp_liberal_strength;

    if (Q.ddp_dissent > 0.2) {
        return false;
    } else if (!Q.ddp_newspaper_founded && Q.ddp_resources >= 2 && (heuss || erkelenz) && Q.berliner_tegeblatt >= 5) {
        return true;
    } else if (!Q.ddp_newspaper_founded && Q.ddp_resources >= 2 && (quide || erkelenz) && Q.die_hilfe >= 3) {
        return true;
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

We have founded our own newspaper, and we must now select its head editor.

- @heuss
- @quide
- @baumer
- @erkelenz

@heuss
title: Theodor Heuss, a rising star with a patriotic attitute.
view-if: ddp_regionalist_strength + ddp_business_strength > ddp_labor_strength + ddp_liberal_strength

The right has managed to appoint Theodor Heuss to the position of chief editor.

@quide
title: Ludwig Quidde, notable pacifist.
view-if: (ddp_labor_strength + ddp_liberal_strength > ddp_regionalist_strength + ddp_business_strength) and not (ddp_labor_strength > ddp_regionalist_strength + ddp_business_strength + ddp_liberal_strength)

Ludiwg Quide has been appointed chief editor.

@baumer
title: Gertrud Bäumer, prominent feminist.
view-if: ddp_liberal_strength + ddp_regionalist_strength > ddp_business_strength + ddp_labor_strength

Following a deadlock in deciding upon chief editor, Gertrud Bäumer has been appointed as a compromise

@erkelenz
title: Anton Erkelenz, the labour leader.
view-if: ddp_labor_strength > ddp_regionalist_strength + ddp_business_strength + ddp_liberal_strength

The left has managed to appoint Anton Erkelenz to he position of cheif editor.